    68	```
    69	
    70	removes the `x^2L` term.  These transformations preserve invariant
    71	valuations and give (0.1).  Before this parameter-dependent change the
    72	global coefficient-base polynomial has degree at most three.  Substitution
    73	can create determined higher powers of `t`, but creates no new parameters;
    74	the leading gate below is insensitive to all `O(t^2)` terms.
    75	
    76	Along the generic point of the central line, the total-space Jacobian has
    77	
    78	```text
